---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant Registry as External Registry
    participant LocalDB as Local Storage

    Note over Node,LocalDB: Full Registry Sync Flow

    Node->>Registry: GET /capabilities
    Registry-->>Node: {"sync": {"enabled": true, "mode": "full"}}

    Node->>Node: Check last sync version

    Node->>Registry: GET /sync/snapshot
    activate Registry
    Note right of Registry: Returns complete snapshot:<br/>- taxonomy<br/>- entities<br/>- bookmarks<br/>- weights
    Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (full snapshot + version)
    deactivate Registry

    Node->>LocalDB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Node->>LocalDB: DELETE FROM synced_taxonomy<br/>WHERE registry='uxpatterns'
    Node->>LocalDB: DELETE FROM synced_entities<br/>WHERE registry='uxpatterns'
    Node->>LocalDB: DELETE FROM synced_bookmarks<br/>WHERE registry='uxpatterns'
    Node->>LocalDB: DELETE FROM synced_weights<br/>WHERE registry='uxpatterns'

    Node->>LocalDB: INSERT synced_taxonomy
    Node->>LocalDB: INSERT synced_entities
    Node->>LocalDB: INSERT synced_bookmarks
    Node->>LocalDB: INSERT synced_weights

    Node->>LocalDB: UPDATE registry_metadata<br/>SET last_sync_version='2025-01-14'

    Node->>LocalDB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    Note over Node: Sync complete.<br/>Local queries now include<br/>synced registry data.
